          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q. What could be the problems faced in preparing such a pictograph, if the total number of students present in a class is 33 or 27?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.267,
            0.881,
            0.306
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans. represents 10 students and represent 5 students. But to represent 3 or 7 students accurately by dividing these symbols is not possible."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
